	// prefix is like "" or "myservice" or "svc1"? Original uses Values ["/"] for no prefix, ["/myservice"] for prefix myservice, ["/svc1"] for prefix svc1? Actually for list-services myservice, it used Values ["/myservice"], for list-services with no args, Values ["/"].
